ont size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,serif\"><code><br></code></span></font></div><div><code><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,serif\">I have an error message : </span></font><br></code></div><div><code><br></code></div><div><br><pre style=\"font-size:10pt!important;outline:medium none currentcolor;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;color:rgb(255,255,255);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(0,34,64)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,98,140)\">Error in `.rowNamesDF&lt;-`(x, value = value) : invalid &#39;row.names&#39; length\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,98,140)\">In addition: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,98,140)\">Warning message:\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,98,140)\">In df2genind(newdf, ploidy = 1, strata = df) :</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,98,140)\">\r\n </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,98,140)\"> entirely non-type individual(s) deleted</span></pre><code></code></div><div><code><br></code></div><div><font size=\"2\"><code><br></code></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><code>How can I solve this problem ?<br></code></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><code><br></code></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><code>I share with you my 2 dataframe. <br></code></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><code><br></code></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><code>Thanks a lot ! <br></code></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><code><br></code></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><code><br></code></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><code>Quentin <br></code></font></div><div><code><br></code></div></div>"
